  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till FCI f&#xf6;r NGO round table meeting i London aug/sept 2004 med anledning av 10-&#xe5;rsjubileet av Kairokonferensen 1994. Konferensen kommer att ledas av IPPF och 700 deltagare &#xe4;r inbjudna. St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r politiskt viktigt och faller v&#xe4;l samman med regeringens prioritet p&#xe5; SRHR, Sidas H&#xe4;lsopolicy och SRHR strategin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to FCI for the NGO Roundtable meeting in London sept/okt 2004. The meeting will focus on the Cairo Agenda and support its implementation. The Swedish support is therefore of political importance as Sweden is one of the active partners. The support is in agreement with the Governments priority for SRHR, the Sida&apos;s health policy and the SRHR strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
